{"id":"n9412951948","headline":"Peru Glaciers Retreat 56% Since 1962, Threatening Long-Term Water Security","summary":"Data from INAIGEM showed Peru has lost 56% of its total glacier surface area since 1962. The La Viuda mountain range near Lima lost 88% of its ice coverage, straining regional water reserves.","why":"Glacial meltwater supplies major Peruvian coastal cities, agricultural irrigation projects, and hydroelectric power plants.","category":"economy","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Lima","country":"Peru","lat":-12.046,"lon":-77.043,"region":"latam"},"entities":[{"name":"INAIGEM","ticker":null}],"links":[],"source":{"name":"El Comercio","url":"https://elcomercio.pe/economia/peru/el-cambio-climatico-reduce-las-reservas-de-agua-del-peru-y-pone-a-prueba-su-seguridad-hidrica-l-ultimas-noticia/"},"sources":[{"name":"El Comercio","url":"https://elcomercio.pe/economia/peru/el-cambio-climatico-reduce-las-reservas-de-agua-del-peru-y-pone-a-prueba-su-seguridad-hidrica-l-ultimas-noticia/"}],"published_at":"2026-10-28T22:12:38Z","retrieved_at":"2026-10-28T22:38:32Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"score":48.3,"content_hash":"2257cb5f95c22c06","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/housing-construction-1080589.jpg","alt":"housing construction (illustration)","credit":"jarmoluk","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/architect-building-joy-planning-1080589/"}}